  "notes": "The verb form of {懐|なつ}かしい (nostalgic). Expresses actively engaging with nostalgic feelings.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{懐|なつ}かしむ (to feel nostalgic about ~)\n- {懐|なつ}かしみながら (while reminiscing)\n- {懐|なつ}かしむように (as if nostalgic)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {懐|なつ}かしい: nostalgic (adjective)\n- {思|おも}い{出|で}: memory, recollection\n- {郷愁|きょうしゅう}: homesickness, nostalgia",
